            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Women are the unpaid case workers of the American health care system and they don't trust insurers mainly because insurers aren't doing enough to earn that trust. Among other things, price transparency and better cooperation between payers and providers might help address this situation.</AbstractText>
